<title>GREECE: GREECE RAISES 185BLN DRS FROM 9.6PCT 12M T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>GREECE RAISES 185BLN DRS FROM 9.6PCT 12M T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grece's ministry of finance said in a statement it raised 185 billion drachmas on Wednesday through a public offering of 12-month T-bills yielding a gross 9.6 percent. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
